  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'At the end of the tunnel, we come across the Restroom, where we have a
    moment of respite and experience:


    - Event - a mini-event that, depending
    on the chosen option, yields different.

    They can manipulate resources, deal
    damage, and engage in many other interactions. Can also be ignored.


    - Craft
    - Collected resources can be spent on creating gadgets or robots.

    Gadgets
    are assigned to robots (in the swarm panel, after clicking on the particular
    unit), which grant them additional attributes in the form of statistics. Robots,
    in turn, are additional companions who will aid us in our adventure!


    -
    Swarm - A place where we manage the robots resources! This is where we replenish
    their health and energy, assign created gadgets, and, above all, learn more about
    our team members!


    - Choose Path - Choose the path ahead. To complete the
    game, we must reach the very end, but before that, tunnels await us. Their contents
    are unknown to us, but we can scan them (RMB) for 1 pulsite and discover what
    they hide. WARNING - choosing this path immediately throws you into a tunnel!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
